# CODEOWNERS — AMD/Xilinx Board Store
#
# This file controls who is automatically requested as a reviewer when
# a pull request modifies files matching the listed patterns.
# It also enforces that specific paths can ONLY be merged with approval
# from the designated owner teams (requires "Require review from code owners"
# to be enabled in branch-protection settings for the default branch).
#
# Syntax:  <path-pattern>   <@user or @org/team> ...
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW AMD INTERNAL EMPLOYEES MANAGE THIS FILE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Add an AMD engineer   → append their GitHub handle (or a team) to the
#                         relevant line, e.g.:  @Xilinx/board-store-ci-team
#                                                @amd-gh-username
#
# Remove an AMD engineer → delete their handle from the relevant line.
#
# Move responsibility   → move the handle to the appropriate path pattern.
#
# All changes to this file require a PR approved by at least one current
# member of @Xilinx/board-store-ci-team (enforced by the last rule below).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Default: AMD board-store maintainers own everything ───────────────────────
*                                       @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers  @ADubeyAMD

# ── Board files submitted by external contributors ────────────────────────────
# Reviews ensure correctness of XML / JSON before merge.
boards/**                               @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers  @ADubeyAMD

# ── Catalog & utility files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
catalog/**                              @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers
utility/**                              @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers

# ── CI scripts & workflows — AMD CI team approval required ───────────────────
# Only members of board-store-ci-team can approve changes to the automation
# scripts, preventing external contributors from altering CI behaviour.
.github/**                              @Xilinx/board-store-ci-team  @ADubeyAMD
.github/scripts/board_validator_basic.py  @Xilinx/board-store-ci-team  @ADubeyAMD
.github/workflows/board_pr_validation.yml @Xilinx/board-store-ci-team  @ADubeyAMD

# ── Repo-level docs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md                                    @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers  @ADubeyAMD
Board-File-Structure-Reference.md      @Xilinx/board-store-maintainers  @ADubeyAMD
